{"seq":1,"slug":"spec-param-query","title":"3C 规格参数精确检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/vertical-category-search/electronics-home-search/spec-param-query","wordCount":2253,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"3c-规格参数精确检索\">3C 规格参数精确检索</h1><p>3C 品类的搜索矛盾在于：用户的信息需求被压缩成几个精确的数值或枚举，而这些数值在商品数据里以极其不一致的形式存在。用户搜「1TB 固态硬盘 NVMe」，正确的结果必须同时满足容量 1TB、类型 SSD、接口 NVMe 三个条件，且这三个条件在检索里应当是硬过滤而不是相关性投票。这一篇讲如何把参数变成可精确检索的字段。参数识别与权重的通用方法见 <a href=\"../category-search-diff/category-attribute-weight\">各品类关键属性与权重差异</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-参数的类型学与索引策略\">核心概念：参数的类型学与索引策略</h2><p>3C 参数不是同质的，按可检索性分四类，索引方式各不相同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数类型</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>索引方式</th>\n<th>典型陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>精确枚举</strong></td>\n<td>接口类型（USB-C/HDMI 2.1）、无线协议</td>\n<td>keyword 字段 + 精确匹配</td>\n<td>同义写法（Type-C / USB C / USB-C）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>数值标量</strong></td>\n<td>容量、功率、刷新率、像素</td>\n<td>numeric 字段 + 精确/区间</td>\n<td>单位混用（GB vs GiB、W vs VA）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>数值区间</strong></td>\n<td>屏幕尺寸、重量、续航</td>\n<td>numeric 字段 + range</td>\n<td>用户给区间与商品给点值的匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>结构化组合</strong></td>\n<td>分辨率（1920x1080）、尺寸（长宽高）</td>\n<td>拆分字段或多值字段</td>\n<td>顺序问题（1080x1920 是否同一物）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>层级/谱系</strong></td>\n<td>芯片型号（骁龙 8 Gen 3）、代际</td>\n<td>层级字段 + 祖先匹配</td>\n<td>新型号未及时入库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>精确枚举的第一件事是建同义词表。</strong> 「Type-C」「USB C」「USB-C」「USB Type-C」「TypeC」必须归一到一个值。这不是可选项——如果这五个写法在索引里是五个不同的值，用户搜任意一个都只能命中五分之一的结果。这类同义词表在 3C 品类通常有 200~500 条，规模不大但价值极高，属于必须人工维护的资产。通用同义词与多语言分析链属于平台层的多语言分析链能力，本 hub 只做品类特有的型号与规格归一。</p>\n<p><strong>数值标量必须带单位元数据。</strong> 只存 <code>1024</code> 无法知道是 GB 还是 MB。字段设计应带单位与量纲：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"capacity_raw: &quot;1TB&quot;&#10;capacity_bytes: 1099511627776&#10;capacity_unit: &quot;byte&quot;&#10;capacity_source: &quot;title_parsed&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>capacity_raw: \"1TB\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>capacity_bytes: 1099511627776</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>capacity_unit: \"byte\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>capacity_source: \"title_parsed\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>检索时按 bytes 精确匹配或区间比较，展示时用 raw。<strong>单位换算是 3C 排序错误的一大来源</strong>：用户搜「2TB 硬盘」，一个标 2000GB 的商品必须命中。如果用字符串匹配「2TB」，它会被漏掉；只有归一化到 bytes 才能正确命中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数值区间的双向匹配\">数值区间的双向匹配</h2><p>区间参数（尺寸、重量、续航）的检索问题比标量复杂，因为用户和商品两侧都可能给区间，形成四种组合。</p>\n<p>设用户条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[u_l, u_h]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，商品参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[p_l, p_h]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>用户给区间，商品给点值</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\in [u_l, u_h]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，标准区间包含。</li>\n<li><strong>用户给点值，商品给区间</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u \\in [p_l, p_h]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。例如用户搜「15.6 英寸笔记本」，一个标注「15.4~15.6 英寸（含边框）」的商品应命中。</li>\n<li><strong>双方都是区间</strong>：交集非空即可 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[u_l,u_h] \\cap [p_l,p_h] \\neq \\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∅</span></span></span></span></span>，但应优先排序交集更大的，因为重叠度反映匹配强度。</li>\n<li><strong>用户给不等式</strong>：「15 英寸以下」「1kg 以内」，退化为单边约束。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>重叠度的量化用 Jaccard 或重叠长度比例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>overlap</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{overlap}(u, p) = \\frac{\\min(u_h, p_h) - \\max(u_l, p_l)}{\\min(u_h - u_l,\\ p_h - p_l)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">overlap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个值可以直接作为排序特征。注意分母取两者中较短的长度，避免商品区间越宽得分越高（那会鼓励商家标超宽区间）。</p>\n<p><strong>双边开放区间要特殊处理</strong>。「15 英寸以下」的下界是 0 还是 10？数值字段的三个状态必须区分：有值、值为 0、值缺失。把「缺失」当成 0 会导致区间查询产生大量误命中——一个没有标注重量的商品会被「1kg 以内」命中，但实际上用户拿到手可能超重。<strong>缺失值应默认不参与区间过滤</strong>，除非用户显式接受「参数未知」的结果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q[用户查询] --&gt; QP[查询参数解析]&#10;    QP --&gt; T{参数类型}&#10;    T --&gt;|精确枚举| E[同义词归一 + 精确过滤]&#10;    T --&gt;|数值标量| N[单位归一 + 等值/区间]&#10;    T --&gt;|数值区间| R[重叠度计算]&#10;    T --&gt;|结构化组合| C[拆分字段逐维匹配]&#10;    E --&gt; F[硬过滤]&#10;    N --&gt; F&#10;    R --&gt; F&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; S[软加权:重叠度/匹配维度数]&#10;    S --&gt; O[候选集]\">graph TD\n    Q[用户查询] --&gt; QP[查询参数解析]\n    QP --&gt; T{参数类型}\n    T --&gt;|精确枚举| E[同义词归一 + 精确过滤]\n    T --&gt;|数值标量| N[单位归一 + 等值/区间]\n    T --&gt;|数值区间| R[重叠度计算]\n    T --&gt;|结构化组合| C[拆分字段逐维匹配]\n    E --&gt; F[硬过滤]\n    N --&gt; F\n    R --&gt; F\n    C --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; S[软加权:重叠度/匹配维度数]\n    S --&gt; O[候选集]</pre><h2 id=\"参数匹配从硬过滤退化为软加权的时机\">参数匹配从硬过滤退化为软加权的时机</h2><p>一个反直觉但重要的工程判断：<strong>参数匹配不能永远做硬过滤，需要能降级</strong>。原因有三。</p>\n<p><strong>原因一：召回不足。</strong> 一个加了三个参数约束的查询，在长尾品类上可能命中为零。此时正确的行为不是返回空结果，而是逐步放宽最不重要的约束，并把放宽的信息明确告知用户（「已放宽『接口类型』以显示更多结果」）。这比空结果页的转化率高得多。</p>\n<p><strong>原因二：参数覆盖不全。</strong> 3C 商品的参数覆盖率通常在 60%~85% 之间，仍有大量商品缺参数。硬过滤会让这些商品在所有精确查询中永久不可见，形成「劣币驱逐良币」——参数齐全的劣质商品持续曝光，参数缺失的优质商品沉底。解法是给参数缺失的商品一个「可被软加权召回」的通道。</p>\n<p><strong>原因三：用户表达不精确。</strong> 用户搜「快的固态硬盘」时没有明确参数，此时参数只能用于软加权。硬过滤只适用于用户明确给出约束的场合。</p>\n<p>降级策略的规则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>参数处理</th>\n<th>结果呈现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户明确给出参数 + 召回充足</td>\n<td>硬过滤</td>\n<td>正常展示，标注匹配的参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户明确给出参数 + 召回不足</td>\n<td>重要性低的参数转为软加权</td>\n<td>分区展示「精确匹配」与「近似匹配」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户未给参数（宽泛查询）</td>\n<td>全部软加权</td>\n<td>展示参数摘要供用户二次筛选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品参数缺失</td>\n<td>不参与硬过滤</td>\n<td>标注「参数待确认」，可被软加权召回</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这条表格的第三行常被忽略：<strong>宽泛查询下，参数的价值在于帮用户快速缩小范围，而不是排序</strong>。用户搜「蓝牙耳机」，最有用的不是把参数强的排前面，而是在筛选器里列出「主动降噪」「入耳式」「续航 &gt; 8 小时」这些真实分布集中的参数，让用户一键收窄。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参数检索的质量监控\">参数检索的质量监控</h2><p>参数检索的错误有两种，都需要独立监控。</p>\n<p><strong>假阴性（该命中没命中）。</strong> 最典型的来源是归一化遗漏——出现了同义词表未覆盖的新写法。监控方式是定期抽查高频参数查询的召回量，对召回量突变（尤其是骤降）的查询做人工检查。新机型、新接口标准发布后的几周是高发期。</p>\n<p><strong>假阳性（不该命中却命中）。</strong> 通常来自数值解析错误，例如把型号里的数字当成规格（「小米 14」被解析成 14 英寸）、把包装尺寸当成产品尺寸、把「支持最大 2TB」当成「容量 2TB」。<strong>型号与规格的歧义解析是 3C 抽取最难的环节</strong>，需要结合字段位置、上下文词（「容量」「尺寸」前缀）与型号白名单共同判断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缺陷</th>\n<th>检测方式</th>\n<th>修复</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同义词遗漏</td>\n<td>高频参数查询召回量监控</td>\n<td>扩充同义词表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>型号数字误解析</td>\n<td>抽样校验 + 型号白名单</td>\n<td>增加上下文约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位换算错误</td>\n<td>跨单位查询用例回归</td>\n<td>统一量纲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包装/商品尺寸混淆</td>\n<td>退货原因关联分析</td>\n<td>字段来源优先级规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数缺失商品沉底</td>\n<td>曝光分布分析</td>\n<td>软加权通道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行的监控尤为重要：定期检查「参数缺失商品」的曝光占比是否在合理范围（通常应与其商品数占比相当，误差不超过 20%）。如果显著偏低，说明硬过滤过严，长期会打击商家补全参数的意愿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>3C 参数分五类（精确枚举、数值标量、数值区间、结构化组合、层级谱系），索引方式各不相同，不能统一当成关键词。</li>\n<li>同义词归一（Type-C 的多种写法）与单位归一（TB/GB → bytes）是必须人工维护的高价值资产。</li>\n<li>区间参数用重叠度量化，分母取较短区间以防商家虚标宽区间；缺失值与 0 必须区分，缺失默认不参与硬过滤。</li>\n<li>参数匹配必须支持降级：召回不足时逐级放宽并告知用户，参数覆盖不全时给缺失商品软加权通道，宽泛查询时参数的价值在筛选器而非排序。</li>\n<li>质量监控要同时覆盖假阴性（同义词遗漏、召回量骤降）与假阳性（型号数字误解析、包装尺寸混淆），并监控参数缺失商品的曝光占比。</li>\n<li>参数归一化产出的结构化字段是兼容关系的基础，见 <a href=\"compatibility-model\">型号兼容（配件适配设备）</a>；参数的展示方式见 <a href=\"../beauty-fresh-other/vertical-result-ui\">各品类结果页展示差异</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"3C 规格参数精确检索","id":"3c-规格参数精确检索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：参数的类型学与索引策略","id":"核心概念-参数的类型学与索引策略"},{"level":2,"text":"数值区间的双向匹配","id":"数值区间的双向匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"参数匹配从硬过滤退化为软加权的时机","id":"参数匹配从硬过滤退化为软加权的时机"},{"level":2,"text":"参数检索的质量监控","id":"参数检索的质量监控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"以图搜款与相似款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/vertical-category-search/fashion-apparel-search/visual-fashion-search"},"next":{"title":"型号兼容（配件适配设备）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/vertical-category-search/electronics-home-search/compatibility-model"}}